  "local_changes": [
    "Own metadata identifier; all upstream authors and file license notices retained.",
    "Compact single stripe of icon-plus-caption cells, bounded to 64–84 logical pixels.",
    "Classic inset background and instantaneous pressed task SVG states.",
    "Native task models, menus, grouping, drag and drop, accessibility and keyboard actions retained.",
    "Separate icon wells and caption strips in a recessed teal housing, with an 8 px heading and a minimum applet height of 56 px for the existing 64 px panel; native group popup rows are retained.",
